  square([30,18], center=true); // Flat width and depth in XY.`),"A hexagonal spacer":Ae("A 6 mm thick hexagonal spacer with a round 8 mm diameter centre hole.","Change the outer $fn=6 to $fn=8; the outside becomes octagonal while the bore remains round.",`
