  projection(cut=true) // Keep only the section at Z=0.
    translate([0,0,-6]) // Move the ball down to select the slice.
      sphere(10, $fn=40);`),"Twisted, tapered column":Ae("A 30 mm tall column whose rectangular top is smaller and turned 90 degrees.","Set twist=0; the tapered column loses its spiral sides.",`
