  square([12,8], center=true); // Centring keeps the twist around its middle.`),"A hollow bowl":Ae("A flared bowl, 50 mm across at the rim and 24 mm tall, with a closed floor.","Change angle=360 to angle=270; the missing quarter exposes the wall cross-section.",`
