scale([1.6,1,1])
  cylinder(h=6, r=10, $fn=48); // Start with a round disk.`),"Set a ball’s width proportionally":Ae("A ball resized to 30 mm along X while retaining its proportions.","Change [30,0,0] to [40,0,0]; all dimensions grow together.",`
