resize([30,0,0], auto=true)
  sphere(5, $fn=32); // The original radius need not be calculated manually.`),"Paired mirrored tabs":Ae("Two separate rectangular tabs mirrored across X=0, with a 6 mm gap between them.","Change the tab offset from 3 to 5; the gap increases to 10 mm.",`
