depth=width*0.6; // Keep depth at 60% of the width.
height=5;        // Independent thickness.
cube([width,depth,height]); // Build from the named dimensions.`),"Choose a size with a condition":Ae("A 32 × 16 × 4 mm block selected by a yes/no parameter.","Set wide=false; the block becomes 18 × 9 × 4 mm.",`
