  translate([i*14,0,0]) // Keep neighbouring posts separate.
    cylinder(h=heights[i], r=4, $fn=24); // Read this entry's height.`),"A six-hole bolt circle":Ae("A disk with six 5 mm diameter through-holes arranged evenly around its centre.","Change the cutter radius from 2.5 to 3; every hole becomes 6 mm across.",`
