right=[[12,0],[0,8],[-12,8]]; // Continue around the same boundary.
echo(points=len(concat(left,right))); // Five points after joining.
linear_extrude(4)
  polygon(concat(left,right)); // Preserve pairs while joining the lists.`),"A sampled turned profile":Ae("A solid turned part that widens at mid-height and narrows towards its top.","Change the middle table radius from 12 to 16; the middle bulge grows.",`
