index=search(10,sizes)[0]; // First matching position is index 1.
// Read the matching diameter, then divide by two for the radius.
cylinder(h=8, r=sizes[index]/2, $fn=32);`),"A numbered label":Ae("Separate solid M6 letters, 2 mm thick, without a supporting plate.","Change the number 6 to 8; the lettering becomes M8.",`
